# CQ16 [Sensing & failures] Which property (type of data) does each sensor measure, and what does it monitor?
PREFIX optimar: <https://w3id.org/optimar#>
PREFIX sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/>
PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
SELECT ?sensor ?dataType ?monitored WHERE {
  ?sensor a/rdfs:subClassOf+ optimar:Sensor .
  { ?sensor optimar:measures|optimar:measuresVibration|optimar:measuresStress|optimar:measuresYawAngle|optimar:measuresPitchAngle|optimar:measuresWindSpeed|optimar:measuresWindDirection ?data . ?data a ?dataType }
  UNION
  { ?sensor optimar:monitors|optimar:measuresTemperatureOf|optimar:monitorsYawOf|optimar:monitorsPitchOf ?monitored }
} ORDER BY ?sensor
